<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-063" chapter-id="c-songshu-063-shenyanzhi-shuren" source-id="s-songshu-063-shenyanzhi-shuren-ws2118589">
  <p id="c-songshu-063-shenyanzhi-shuren:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-063-shenyanzhi-shuren:p001:m0000" ref="bc8_80d_613">沈演之</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-063-shenyanzhi-shuren:p001:m0004" ref="bc8_80d_613">臺真</persName>，吳興武康人也。高祖<persName id="c-songshu-063-shenyanzhi-shuren:p001:m0016" ref="4c2_19b_bf4">充</persName>，晉車騎將軍，吳國內史。曾祖<persName id="c-songshu-063-shenyanzhi-shuren:p001:m0031" ref="4c2_19b_bf4_A">勁</persName>，冠軍陳祐長史，戍金墉城，為鮮卑慕容恪所陷，不屈節見殺，追贈東陽太守。祖<persName id="c-songshu-063-shenyanzhi-shuren:p001:m0068" ref="4c2_19b_bf4_AA">赤黔</persName>，廷尉卿。父<persName id="c-songshu-063-shenyanzhi-shuren:p001:m0076" ref="4c2_19b_bf4_AAA">叔任</persName>，少有幹質，初為揚州主簿，高祖太尉參軍，吳、山陰令，治皆有聲。<persName id="c-songshu-063-shenyanzhi-shuren:p001:m0109" ref="wip_vh5_2zm_A">朱齡石</persName>伐蜀，為<persName id="c-songshu-063-shenyanzhi-shuren:p001:m0116" ref="wip_vh5_2zm_A">齡石</persName>建威府司馬，加建威將軍。</p>
</text>
